      "title": "About usePopcorn",
      "introAfterBrand": "is a movie and TV series discovery platform designed to help you browse titles, track what you want to watch, and share your ratings and reviews.",
      "body": "You can filter the catalog by genre, release year, country, runtime, and rating, organize titles in your personal watchlist, and unlock personalized recommendations based on your taste profile.",
